        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Egg Madras delivers big heat and tang from a tomato and tamarind base. It gives an easy weeknight meal when there is little else in the kitchen. Do not overcook the eggs or they will turn rubbery in the sauce."}]
      },
